## 1. Purpose

This policy sets land, construction, and development lending limits.

## 2. Scope

Applies to land acquisition and construction facilities. Stabilized CRE after conversion follows CP-CRE-2026-01.

## 3. Thresholds

- Maximum LTV for land is {{ facts.max_ltv_land }}.
- Interest reserve minimum is {{ facts.interest_reserve_minimum }}.
- Inspection frequency is {{ facts.inspection_frequency }}.
- A {{ facts.completion_guarantee }} is required.
- Maximum interest-only during construction is {{ facts.construction_interest_only_max }}.

## 4. Authority

CRE construction LTV in CP-CRE-2026-01 (55%) is for construction of income-producing CRE; land LTV in this policy is {{ facts.max_ltv_land }}.

## 5. Related policies

See Commercial Real Estate (CP-CRE-2026-01) and Collateral Valuation (CP-COL-2026-01).
